      }
    ],
```

### Verification
After ALL changes:
1. Run `cd /workspaces/semio && npm install` to link the new vscode workspace
2. Run `cd /workspaces/semio/semio/vscode && npx tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript compilation
3. Run `cd /workspaces/semio/semio/vscode && npx vite build 2>&1 | tail -5` to verify build
4. Run `cd /workspaces/semio/repo/vscode && npx tsc --noEmit` to verify the reverted extension still compiles
5. Run `cd /workspaces/semio/repo/vscode && npx vite build 2>&1 | tail -5` to verify the reverted extension still builds

Report ALL results.

